# Archive

Read `AGENTS.md` first, then the nearest subtree `AGENTS.md`.

- Active code: `apps/`, `packages/`, `native/kernel/`
- `skills/_legacy/` is frozen. Load it only when the user names that path.
- Keep `.waygent/`, `.agentlens/`, `.claude/`, `.codex-orchestrator/`,
  `.orchestrator/`, `.superpowers/`, caches, build outputs, and secrets out of
  git.
- Verify with the smallest relevant command and report that result.
